psionics:
  type: "master"
  isp_base: "4d6x10"
  powers: ["Astral Projection", "Clairvoyance", "Commune with Animals", "Commune with Spirit", "Dispel Spirits", "Divination", "Empathy", "Induce Nightmare", "Insert Memory", "Intuitive Combat", "Invisible Haze", "Machine Ghost", "Mask I.S.P. & Psionics", "Mask P.P.E.", "Meditation", "Mediumship/Clairsentience", "Mental Illusion", "Mimic Skills", "Object Read (Psychometry)", "Precognition", "Presence Sense", "Read Dimensional Portal", "Remote Viewing", "See Aura", "See The Invisible", "Sense Dimensional Anomaly", "Sense Evil", "Sense Magic", "Sense Time", "Sensory Link", "Sixth Sense", "Speed Reading", "Telepathy", "Total Recall", "Detect Psionics", "Bio-Regeneration (Super)", "Alter Aura", "Death Trance", "Ectoplasm", "Mind Block"]
  powers_starting: 7
  categories_allowed: ["Super"]
natural_abilities:
  - name: "Impervious to Poison, Toxins, Drugs and Gases"
    description: "None of them affect it."
  - name: "Feeds on Ambient Energy"
    description: "Feeds on ambient mystic and psionic energy, so it does not breathe air or require food and water."
  - name: "See the Invisible"
    description: "Always."
  - name: "Nightvision"
    description: "300 ft (91.5 m)."
  - name: "Fire and Cold Resistant"
    description: "Fire and cold do half damage."
  - name: "Antennae"
    description: "Highly sensitive: they feel movement in the air like motion detectors, give amplified hearing (the same as the bionic equivalent) and identify smells on a molecular level, like a molecular analyzer. It recognizes people and places by scent at 65%, maneuvers in darkness, and tracks by scent at 40%."
  - name: "Float and Fly"
    description: "In its natural form it floats and flies at a Spd of up to 6D6. As an energy sphere it travels at 300 mph (482 km)."
special_abilities:
  - name: "Four Minds in One Body"
    description: "The ball of flesh is quartered, and each quarter or lobe is an individual being with its own mind; this class is one of those minds. Each mind rolls its own I.Q., M.E., M.A. and P.B.; P.S., P.P. and P.E. do not apply to the natural body. Each has its own 4D6x10 P.P.E. and 4D6x10 I.S.P. (150 to 200 is typical), its own two comprehensive areas of knowledge and its own bonuses. With all four present in the natural body they share 40 more P.P.E. and 120 more I.S.P. Each active mind has two physical, magic or psionic attacks per melee, eight in all with all four awake; physical attacks are likely to need one or more ectoplasmic limbs. The four discuss and agree which of them may leave the body and for how long, typically one or two at a time; a mind that has left leaves its lobe dormant, as if asleep, unable to attack, think or talk with the others, though the others can always find it by astral projection and talk to it by telepathy."
  - name: "Energy Form and Dimensional Travel"
    description: "A mind may leave its lobe as a basketball-size energy sphere (2D4x10 M.D.C., 300 mph/482 km) and dimensionally teleport into a dimension it has already discovered and observed from the astral plane. It then has 24 hours to build and bond with a body of stone and/or earth (the Guardian form), rearranging dense molecules to build it; the bonding takes about an hour, and that structure is its one and only body in that dimension. Its natural body, back in the astral plane, is unhurt. It may abandon the guardian body at any time and return to its natural body, but cannot travel to another dimension for 4D6 days afterward. If the energy being loses all its M.D.C. it is hurled back into its natural body and cannot return to that dimension for 1D6 months."
  - name: "Guardian Form"
    description: "A body of stone or earth 7 to 10 feet (2.1 to 3 m) tall, three to six tons, male or female, humanoid, animal-like or monstrous. P.S. 4D6+12, P.P. 2D6+10, P.E. not applicable, Spd 4D6. M.D.C. 2D4x100 for the body (400 or 500 is typical), while the essence inside keeps 2D4x10. Horror Factor 11. Five hand to hand or psionic attacks per melee, or two magic attacks. In place of the natural form''s bonuses: +4 to strike, parry and dodge, +2 on initiative, +2 to roll with punch, +4 to pull punch, critical strike on an unmodified 19-20, mega-damage punches and kicks, +2 to save vs psionics, +2 vs all magic and +4 vs Horror Factor. Sees the invisible, nightvision 300 ft (91.5 m), impervious to heat, fire, cold, gases, drugs and poison; can reshape itself into a pillar of stone or a boulder. A destroyed body is rebuilt in eight hours; lost limbs and lesser damage are restored in four. Its molecular manipulation works on its own body only. Mental attributes, alignment, skills, psionics and magic are unchanged."
  - name: "Guardian Vulnerabilities"
    description: "The essence in the stone is vulnerable to psionic mind control, mind bolts, mind wipe, exorcism and empathic transmission, and to the spells exorcism, banishment, summon and control entity, commune with spirits, the luck curse and illusionary magic. A successful exorcism forces the essence out and leaves a mound of earth or rock: the exposed energy being is open to direct energy, magic and psionic attack, and must build a new body within six hours or be sent back to its natural body, stuck in the astral plane for 1D6 months."
  - name: "Astral Journeys"
    description: "+16% to find its way back at the end of an astral journey. The Ogeeyin learn by observing other people, places and planes by astral projection."
  - name: "Stone Magic Knowledge"
    description: "A mind that takes Stone Magic as an area of knowledge has all the abilities and knowledge of the Stone Masters (Rifts Atlantis)."
  - name: "Spell Magic Knowledge"
    description: "A mind that takes Spell Magic as an area of knowledge understands the principles of magic, recognizes runes and rune weapons, and knows four spells from each spell level one through six. Take this only with the Spell Magic area."
    magic:
      type: "spell"
      spells_starting: 24
      spells_starting_groups:
        - { count: 4, spell_levels: [1], note: "Four level-one spells." }
        - { count: 4, spell_levels: [2], note: "Four level-two spells." }
        - { count: 4, spell_levels: [3], note: "Four level-three spells." }
        - { count: 4, spell_levels: [4], note: "Four level-four spells." }
        - { count: 4, spell_levels: [5], note: "Four level-five spells." }
        - { count: 4, spell_levels: [6], note: "Four level-six spells." }
  - name: "No Spell Magic"
    description: "This mind did not take Spell Magic as an area of knowledge, and knows no spells."
  - { choose: 1, from: ["Spell Magic Knowledge", "No Spell Magic"], note: "Spell Magic Knowledge only with the Spell Magic area of knowledge." }
restrictions:
  - "Cybernetics: none, incompatible."
  - "Skill proficiency seldom exceeds seventh level, and is usually limited to a few broad areas."
